sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Browser UI
  participant UploadAPI as Upload Router
  participant SepAPI as Separation Router
  participant Service as SeparationService
  participant Storage as Local Storage
  participant DB as SQLite Database
  participant ML as NeoSSNet Inference
  participant ResultAPI as Result Router

  User->>UI: Choose mixed WAV file
  UI->>UploadAPI: POST /upload
  UploadAPI->>UploadAPI: Validate file type, size, and WAV readability

  alt Invalid upload
    UploadAPI->>DB: Insert system_log error
    UploadAPI-->>UI: 400 validation error
    UI-->>User: Show clear upload error
  else Valid upload
    UploadAPI->>Storage: Save WAV to storage/uploads/raw
    Storage-->>UploadAPI: Return stored_path
    UploadAPI->>DB: Insert uploaded_audio row
    UploadAPI->>DB: Insert system_log info
    UploadAPI-->>UI: Return uploaded_audio_id

    UI->>SepAPI: POST /separate/{audio_id}
    SepAPI->>Service: Start separation for uploaded audio
    Service->>DB: Read upload metadata and active model
    Service->>DB: Create separation_job with running status
    Service->>Storage: Read uploaded mixed WAV
    Service->>ML: Preprocess waveform and run NeoSSNet
    ML-->>Service: Return heart and lung waveforms
    Service->>Storage: Save heart WAV and lung WAV outputs
    Storage-->>Service: Return output file paths
    Service->>DB: Insert separation_result paths
    Service->>DB: Insert evaluation_metric rows when available
    Service->>DB: Update separation_job to completed
    Service-->>SepAPI: Return job_id and result status
    SepAPI-->>UI: Separation completed

    UI->>ResultAPI: GET /result/{job_id}
    ResultAPI->>DB: Read job, result, metrics, and logs
    ResultAPI-->>UI: Return result metadata and playback links
    UI->>ResultAPI: GET /download/{job_id}/{type}
    ResultAPI->>Storage: Resolve heart or lung output file
    ResultAPI-->>UI: Stream/download WAV file
    UI-->>User: Preview and download separated audio
  end
